  weaponName: Ividi Kidivri
  lore: 
  description: "A long, dark wand carved from elder wood, adorned with distinct bone-like
    knots running along its slender shaft, and crowned with a smooth, bulbous grip
    that fits naturally in the hand of its true master. Rumored to be unbeatable
    in magical combat, this wand channels raw, unrelenting power \u2014 amplifying
    every spell cast with terrifying precision and force. Once belonging to Death
    himself, it chooses only the bold and the worthy, turning the tide of any duel
    in an instant."
